{"id":"wb-5-136","name":"米兰遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"米兰遗址","text":"米兰遗址，位于中国新疆维吾尔族自治区，是一组不同年代的跨文化遗址群。其中有鄯善国伊循城遗址，汉代屯田，唐代古戍堡遗址等。曾于佛寺壁画中发现了3世纪带有古罗马风格的有翼天使图像。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%B1%B3%E5%85%B0%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":94803303,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94803303","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/50d890da49e97160371e247b.jpg","title":"Miran_fresco1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Miran_fresco1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/Miran_fresco1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"未知Unknown author","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"Fresco from Stupa shrine M III (Miran, China)","width":320,"height":307}}